\begin{aligned}
E_{\mathrm{COM}}&=\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}}\left[\left\{\frac{1}{M}\sum_{m=1}^{M}y_m(\mathbf{x})-h(\mathbf{x})\right\}^2\right]\\
